    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4" style="background-color:#1e2f6e;">1</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2" style="color:#1e2f6e;">Pick your state and role</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Choose your state from Michigan, California, Texas, or Florida. Select your role: GC, subcontractor, or supplier. LienForm loads the correct statutory framework automatically.</p>
