        <div class="w-14 h-14 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-4" style="background-color:#1e2f6e;">2</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2" style="color:#1e2f6e;">Fill in your project details</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Enter the property address, owner info, your company details, amount owed, and last furnishing date. The deadline calculator updates in real time as you type.</p>
