          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2">MCL 570.1101–570.1305 (2023)</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Mechanics lien for construction projects. 90-day residential / 180-day commercial deadline.</p>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg font-bold" style="color:#1e2f6e;">$24.99</span>
