    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-navy-800 mb-2">Lien Document Guides</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-500 mb-6">Everything you need to know about lien documents — from preliminary notices to releases.</p>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
