            <span class="text-slate-400 ml-4 shrink-0 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▾</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Yes. MechanicsLienForm uses current statutory citations: California Civil Code §8000–9566 (SB 189, 2019), Texas Property Code Ch. 53 (HB 2237, 2022), Michigan MCL 570.1101 (2023 amendments), and Florida Statute §713. We do not use outdated templates.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden group">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 list-none" style="color:#1e2f6e;">
